WEBVTT

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:04.680
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.280
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed,

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.860
Do they want to protect themselves or other people. Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.820
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.530
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.370 --> 00:00:19.620
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:24.850
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.070
You won’t take away my rights!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.110
Here comes the sea of clouds!

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.110
Wait a second!

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.970
I said, what do you think you’re doing?

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.310
Take that!

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.240
That’s dangerous, you know.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.280
Y-Yes.

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.830
Wanyuudo, you should try teaching, too.

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:05.980
Nah, it’s too much work; I’m not the teaching type.

00:01:05.980 --> 00:01:08.140
Well, I gotta go.

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:10.640
I’ve got an experiment to prepare.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.640
Oh! Almost forgot, me too!

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.530
Yukawa-kun… has changed.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:38.030
Before, when we were in the same class…

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:43.970
Elder Brother

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:13.980
