00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:27.990
Hey, Yukawa, right?

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:31.020
Yes.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.510
By the way, I have a date today.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:37.070
Darn! I’m jealous!

00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:39.220
But I’m short on money.

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.060
So, Yukawa…

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:44.050
How much… is it?

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:46.640
Hmm… How about 30,000?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.050
I don’t have that kind of money.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:52.800
Yukawa, come here.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:57.780
5 o’clock at the station, got it?

00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:04.820
Y-Yes.

00:04:11.490 --> 00:04:14.010
I’ll tell your homeroom teacher, Tange.

00:04:17.260 --> 00:04:18.340
That would be troublesome.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.580
What’s the trouble?

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:23.850
So, tripping was a lie, wasn’t it?

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.060
No, it’s the truth.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:29.780
I just don’t want anyone to be inconvenienced by me.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.810
But…

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.800
If you insist, I won’t come anymore.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.310
Come anymore...?

00:04:39.770 --> 00:04:41.930
To the Nurse’s office.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.300
Or school, even.

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:47.720
It’s OK, I’ll be careful from now on.

00:04:55.620 --> 00:04:57.260
Excuse me.

00:04:57.260 --> 00:05:02.290
Yukawa? His father is a banker, his mother is a housewife,

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:06.820
and he has a younger brother.  It’s a normal family.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:07.710
I see.

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:13.770
Come to think of it, he seems a bit distant during class.

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:16.230
Well, I’ll be careful too from now on.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:26.790
Take this!

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.340
Got him!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.500
Guess I have to go for the head to turn the tables.

00:05:33.870 --> 00:05:37.830
OK, with this special ball, I’ll win!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.490
Ouch!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.710
What?!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.870
Aren’t you ashamed of yourselves?

00:05:57.700 --> 00:05:59.730
You…!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.240
Remember this!

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:09.890
Are you all right?

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.040
Y-Yes.

00:06:13.650 --> 00:06:14.360
Uh…

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.960
You don’t need to thank me.

00:06:23.090 --> 00:06:24.940
Don’t be embarassed.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:27.620
No, really, I…

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:30.450
Even I,

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:35.040
at 21, am hairless!

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:47.860
Takeru?

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.780
Like Yamato Takeru?

00:06:50.780 --> 00:06:53.830
I don’t know since I haven’t asked my parents.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.060
But people tell me that all the time.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.870
That the image doesn’t fit.

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:01.240
Nishida-san, what’s your first name?

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.850
I’m Shin.

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:06.490
Like the “fu” in “futsu”.

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:08.500
You’re in college, right?

00:07:08.500 --> 00:07:12.230
Yeah, a junior and studying Kendo.

00:07:12.230 --> 00:07:14.990
Kendo? That’s not a class, is it?

00:07:14.990 --> 00:07:18.300
Just kidding. I’m in law.

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:21.060
So you’re going to be a lawyer?

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:23.360
No, a public prosecutor.

00:07:25.050 --> 00:07:28.940
Right, a prosecutor. That’s perfect for you, Nishida-san!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:34.610
Well, before that, I have to pass the bar exam.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.090
Good luck!

00:07:41.010 --> 00:07:45.260
I’ll work hard, so you too!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:53.200
I couldn’t do that! Kendo…

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:57.440
Don’t you want to be strong? Are you fine with the way things are?

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:02.200
I’m OK with it, since I’ve been this way from when I was young.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.140
It’s not so bad once you get used to it…

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:04.840
Don’t!

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:10.690
But, society’s like that right? There’s no use…

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:15.690
They can only have power through such actions,

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:19.040
so I might as well let them be.

00:08:33.090 --> 00:08:34.470
Wow!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.950
Not quite yet…

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:39.400
Even though you won?

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.270
It’s not about the end result.

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:45.410
Since that’s because of the opponent. It’s my own problem.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.430
Something’s missing.

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.190
Really? I think it’s enough…

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:57.400
You’re strong, smart, and handsome…

00:08:58.910 --> 00:09:00.450
Hmm, really?

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:02.290
O-Of course!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:05.390
Hmm… that’s weird, then why don’t the girls like me?

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:09.430
Maybe they think you’re beyond their reach?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:12.700
Me? Beyond their reach?

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:16.690
Oh, is it wrong to use it for a guy?

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:18.900
Well, I don’t know about that.

00:09:21.820 --> 00:09:24.200
You’re more handsome than me anyway.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.410
That’s not true!

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:28.910
Really? You’ve got a cute face!

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:33.450
C-Cute? I’m a guy, you know…

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.210
Oh right! I’m sorry!

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:41.400
But, if you’re a guy…

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.460
What is it?

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.420
If you’re a guy~

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:50.460
If you’re a guy~

00:09:47.700 --> 00:09:50.460
What’re you trying to say?

00:09:51.100 --> 00:09:53.670
Let’s practice during spring break!

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:15.490
How do you like it? Isn’t it nice after exercising?

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.810
What’s the matter?

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.060
Some sweat got in my eye.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:23.400
Let me get it out.

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.260
Got it out!

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:32.610
Yes.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.470
Seconds!

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:40.960
Takeru, you’ve changed.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.240
Really?

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:43.870
Yeah, you have.

00:10:43.870 --> 00:10:49.010
Mom was surprised when you suddenly said you wanted things for Kendo.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:49.910
More importantly…

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.190
Dear,

00:10:51.190 --> 00:10:53.480
shouldn’t we thank that person?

00:10:53.480 --> 00:10:55.400
I think we should…

00:10:55.400 --> 00:10:56.940
Actually, I think we should.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:58.600
Nah, we don’t need to.

00:10:58.600 --> 00:10:59.700
Really!

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:01.610
Even if we did, he wouldn’t accept it.

00:11:01.610 --> 00:11:04.330
Nishida-san’s just like that.

00:11:04.330 --> 00:11:05.170
For everything.

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:09.260
Simple and sturdy, eh?

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:10.340
Exactly!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:14.540
Additionally, he’s an incorruptible, up-and-coming youth.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:18.340
Any adjective like that would fit him.

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:21.270
Anyway, he’s amazing.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.660
He’s one of a kind.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.570
Thanks for the meal!

00:11:34.880 --> 00:11:36.270
Hasn’t he changed recently?

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.910
He’s gotten cooler.

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:05.040
It was a cold after all.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:09.050
It would be better if you left early and went to the hospital.

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:10.260
I’ll do so.

00:12:10.260 --> 00:12:12.110
Oh, Mikage-san.

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:14.700
How’s Yukawa Takeru recently?

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.970
Yukawa-kun?

00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:19.750
Even though we’ve changed classes, he seems to be well.

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:21.420
He’s apparently doing Kendo.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:23.530
Kendo?

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:25.850
Yukawa-kun is doing Kendo?

00:12:25.850 --> 00:12:26.680
Since when?

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:31.830
I don’t know when, but when the new semester began he already had…

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:34.570
Ok, how about the bullying, then?

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:35.220
Hmm?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.170
Oh, nothing. See you.

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.660
Kendo, eh?

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:02.150
You don’t get bored looking at the smoke for so long?

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:02.930
Yes.

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.020
It’s OK, then…

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:06.180
You must be tired!

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.360
This,

00:13:11.360 --> 00:13:12.890
may I ask you to take care of this?

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:15.550
Put it somewhere over there.

00:13:15.550 --> 00:13:16.340
Yes.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.560
Thank you very much.

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:24.300
It’s that child.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:26.550
Ah, that one.

00:13:26.550 --> 00:13:30.250
He’s polite for a youth of today.

00:13:31.930 --> 00:13:35.620
And I like how’s he’s so manly.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.680
Although, he’s nothing compared to me!

00:13:57.170 --> 00:13:58.350
What happened?

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.340
Carsick.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:01.070
Then…

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:06.150
Does the wind reach you?

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.570
Ah.

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.830
It’s tough, isn’t it?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:15.420
Is the bar exam hard?

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:18.690
It’s not just the exam, but also what comes after.

00:14:18.690 --> 00:14:20.800
You’re Nishida-san, you’ll be fine!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.420
I believe in you!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.430
Thanks, I’ll try hard.

00:14:32.580 --> 00:14:36.380
Someone, wind the spring on my back!

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.900
Here we go!

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.050
What was that?

00:14:57.830 --> 00:14:59.110
That hurt!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:04.480
Did this hit you?

00:15:05.570 --> 00:15:06.860
No, no…

00:15:06.860 --> 00:15:10.250
I was imagining it, I’m sorry.

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.200
I’m so sorry, did it hurt?

00:15:39.930 --> 00:15:42.700
Next Stop: Wagamura Shrine Entrance.

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:46.800
Here’s the bus!

00:15:52.520 --> 00:15:54.830
What?! Why?!

00:16:00.400 --> 00:16:03.450
I scattered your head, just like you wanted!

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.090
Thank you very much!

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:06.500
Again, I am very sorry.

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.850
Next Stop: Fourth District Intersection.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:12.000
Alright, I’m getting off next!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.030
Stop requested.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:23.520
It suits you!

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:24.620
Y-Yes.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:28.560
Hey! Looks like I’ve forgotten a few places!

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:32.060
Hey, maybe I’ll shave your neck, too!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.070
That… that would be…

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.200
Don’t be so modest!

00:16:37.200 --> 00:16:38.870
Here’s some money, share it.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:44.600
We’ll pass.

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:01.750
I’m fine here.

00:17:03.430 --> 00:17:04.760
Sure.

00:17:07.820 --> 00:17:08.600
Um…

00:17:10.680 --> 00:17:12.160
Don’t worry about it.

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.970
W-What are you talking about?

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.780
You couldn’t do anything about it.

00:17:18.710 --> 00:17:20.290
It’s not like that.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:20.980
Yes, it was.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.200
Do you look down on me?

00:17:26.950 --> 00:17:29.000
It’s OK if you do!

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:31.700
I just want to clarify one thing!

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:33.690
It’s because you were there.

00:17:36.220 --> 00:17:39.000
I couldn’t do anything dangerous because you were there.

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:42.680
I wouldn’t want you to be involved.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:46.930
Well, later.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:56.020
Goodbye.

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:00.320
Again?

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.670
Ichimoku Ren.

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:09.240
OK, Ojou.

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:15.130
Take this.

00:18:15.960 --> 00:18:19.740
If you really want to release the grudge,

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.180
you just have to pull the red string

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:28.590
If you pull the string, it would mean that you signed a contract with me.

00:18:28.590 --> 00:18:31.840
The one you begrudge will be swiftly sent to Hell.

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:36.920
But if you release it,

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:39.850
you’ll have to pay the price.

00:18:40.470 --> 00:18:42.950
If you curse one person, two holes are created.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:48.900
If you sign the contract, your soul will also fall into Hell.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.630
Although, that’s after you die.

00:18:55.320 --> 00:18:57.900
Unable to go to heaven,

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:04.390
your soul will wander through eternity in pain and suffering.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:07.200
There’s no use.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:10.410
But someone has to do it, right?

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:16.620
I know it’s not just him, there are plenty more.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:22.230
I should really send them to Hell, but they have nothing to do with me.

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.280
Nothing to do with me!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.840
Nothing!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.270
Goodbye!

00:19:30.030 --> 00:19:33.830
Your grudge… has been received.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:43.740
Are you tired yet?

00:20:43.740 --> 00:20:47.510
Yes, I was bad! But!

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:48.740
Excuses, eh?

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.550
No, that’s not true!

00:20:51.550 --> 00:20:53.770
Can’t you give me a chance?

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.200
Why?

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.650
I want to make up for it! I want to become a prosecutor and make up for it!

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.020
Please!

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:06.150
It was my childhood dream! To be a prosecutor and defeat evil!

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:10.050
That’s why I’ve worked so hard! So, please!

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.050
Says he, Ojou.

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:17.040
Trapped in darkness, O pitiful shadow.

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:19.840
Hurting people, and degrading them.

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:22.170
Drowned in sin is the ball of karma.

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:28.570
Do yo want to try dying this once?

00:21:42.650 --> 00:21:46.570
Wasn’t everyone else on that bus the same?

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:48.550
And…

00:21:48.550 --> 00:21:50.820
Why only me?

00:21:51.170 --> 00:21:52.840
This grudge…

00:21:54.120 --> 00:21:56.390
Will ferry you to Hell.

00:22:00.830 --> 00:22:03.640
You know without us telling you, don’t tell anyone.

00:22:07.620 --> 00:22:08.660
Yes.

00:22:10.050 --> 00:22:11.920
Did you quit Kendo?

00:22:11.920 --> 00:22:12.710
Yes.

00:22:12.730 --> 00:22:15.820
Why? Even though you were able to change?

00:22:17.100 --> 00:22:22.630
Even if I change a little, it won’t affect society.

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:46.740
I will release the grudge

00:22:44.940 --> 00:22:49.900
Note: Candle says, Yukawa Takeru.

00:22:48.100 --> 00:22:49.900
that you can’t.

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.860 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:19.880 --> 00:24:45.900
Preview

00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:21.770
Your name?

00:24:21.770 --> 00:24:23.490
Niiyama Rima.

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:24.870
Is it really OK?

00:24:24.870 --> 00:24:27.930
I came along with the honor of being a teacher.

00:24:27.930 --> 00:24:31.720
But now, pointing someone to the right path isn’t even allowed.

00:24:32.560 --> 00:24:35.280
I can only stick to dangerous strength.

00:24:35.720 --> 00:24:38.430
If it comes to this, I, as a teacher…

